////----------------------------------------//
///SuperDepth3D Sentinel Profile Automation///
//----------------------------------------////
// Sentinel v1.0.0
//---------------------------------------SENTINEL----------------------------------------//
// Overwatch covers the position and Recon scouts ahead. Sentinel holds the post and     //
// stands watch over the Generic Depth Mod Add-on for as long as the game runs.          //
// The name comes from this.                                                             //
// https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sentry                                                  //
// Since this File hands the Add-on the settings a game wants before it picks a buffer.  //
//---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------//
// Do not edit this file. It is generated, and the next Depth3D shader update replaces   //
// it, so anything changed here is lost. To change a game use the Add-on's own options;  //
// what you save there is kept in ReShade.ini and wins over every default below.         //
//----------------------------------------LICENSE----------------------------------------//
